/**
 * @defgroup StarGeometryOutput StarGeometry — AgML Generated TGeo Output Directory
 * @brief Build-output directory for assembled STAR detector geometry (TGeo format).
 *
 * @details
 * `StarGeometry/` contains no source code. It is the output destination for
 * `TGeoManager` files produced when the AGML geometry assembly step runs.
 * The assembled geometry is written here by `StarTGeoStacker` (via `StVMCMaker`)
 * and subsequently loaded by simulation and reconstruction jobs.
 *
 * @see StarVMCGeometry (source XML definitions in `Geometry/`)
 * @see StarAgmlLib (AGML assembly framework)
 */
